        'Telemetry - Disable'='遙測與診斷資料－關閉'
        'Delivery Optimization - Disable'='傳遞最佳化－關閉'
        'Microsoft Edge - Remove'='Microsoft Edge－移除'
        'BitLocker - Disable'='BitLocker－關閉'
        'Date & Time - Set Time to UTC'='日期與時間－硬體時鐘設為 UTC'
        'Microsoft OneDrive - Remove'='Microsoft OneDrive－移除'
        'File Explorer Home and Gallery - Disable'='檔案總管首頁與圖庫－關閉'
        'Visual Effects - Set to Best Performance'='視覺效果－最佳效能'
        'Disable Reserved Storage'='保留儲存空間－關閉'
        'Restore Point - Create'='建立系統還原點'
        'End Task With Right Click - Enable'='右鍵結束工作－啟用'
        'Storage Sense - Disable'='儲存空間感知器－關閉'
        'Windows AI - Disable And Remove'='Windows AI／Copilot－關閉並移除'
        'Windows Platform Binary Table (WPBT) - Disable'='WPBT－關閉'
        'Prevent Device Companion Apps'='禁止裝置搭配 App 自動安裝'
        'Razer Software Auto-Install - Disable'='Razer 軟體自動安裝－關閉'
        'System Tray Notifications & Calendar - Disable'='系統匣通知與行事曆－關閉'
        'Adobe URL Block List - Enable'='Adobe URL 封鎖清單－啟用'
        'Right-Click Menu Previous Layout - Enable'='傳統右鍵選單－啟用'
        'Disk Cleanup - Run'='磁碟清理－執行'
        'Temporary Files - Remove'='暫存檔－移除'
        'IPv6 - Set IPv4 as Preferred'='IPv6－優先使用 IPv4'
